  fNtcSeries: ["Series resistor (ohm)", "Resistencia en serie (ohm)", "Vorwiderstand (Ohm)", "Résistance série (ohm)", "Resistenza in serie (ohm)", "直列抵抗 (Ω)", "串联电阻 (Ω)", "Resistência em série (ohm)"],
  fNtcR25: ["NTC at 25 °C (ohm)", "NTC a 25 °C (ohm)", "NTC bei 25 °C (Ohm)", "CTN à 25 °C (ohm)", "NTC a 25 °C (ohm)", "25 °C での NTC (Ω)", "25 °C 时的 NTC (Ω)", "NTC a 25 °C (ohm)"],
